Correction of the valve seat
The most common method for correcting unevenness
of the seat surface with a seat grinder.
1.As the valve seat width will be enlarged, first use a
70° grinder, then grind the seat to the standard
dimension 30°, 45° by using the seat grinder with a
15° chamfer.

Intake valve 30°
Exhaust valve 45°

Seat angle 0

2. Knead valve compound with oil and finish the valve
seat with a lapping tool.

3. Final finishing should be done with oil only.

4.Clean the valve and cylinder head with light oil or
the equivalent after valve seat finishing is com-
pleted and make sure that there are no grindings
remaining.

NOTIC

When seat adjustment is necessary, be sure to
check the valve and valve guide.

If the clearance exceeds the tolerance, replace the
